	x: -10.0d,
	y: -3.0d,
	shape: "gear",
	text: [
		"The Akashic Tome is essentially a library that can hold any mod's guidebook. Left-clicking with it in your hand while it's transformed into another book will return it to its default state. You start with one, but in case you lose it, you can get another here. ",
		"",
		"This one doesn't have the Thaumonomicon because the Thaumonomicon doesn't work until you make it the standard way. ",
		"",
		"It also doesn't have the Necronomicon from Abyssalcraft because you'll want to keep it separate, as it holds charge and is used on pedestals while you may want to keep your Akashic Tome on you for other things."
	],
